 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "105-108 is one unit (the reciter joins 105-106-107-108). Paradise and Hell are never drawn: night for the Fire, light for Paradise, geometric for «إن ربك فعال لما يريد», a light plate for «عطاء غير مجذوذ»; no fire, river or gold. «إلا ما شاء ربك» (107:7-10, 108:12-15) is not glossed: the tafsirs differ (Al-Muyassar: the sinful monotheists; As-Sa'di: the time before entering). The plan's «الشقي والسعيد» was the verse's own pair."
 },
